# UNSKOOLERZ — Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# SPA fallback only. Two traps jamworld hit and paid for:
#   1. An explicit "/route /index.html 200" rule does NOT work — Cloudflare
#      normalizes rewrites targeting /index.html into a 308 to /. Use only
#      the wildcard below.
#   2. CF Pages' pretty-URL matching will serve a same-named static .html
#      file in place of an app route (jamworld's /studio was shadowed by
#      studio.html until it was renamed). Don't add bare .html files to
#      public/ whose names collide with an app view.
#
# /api/* is NOT listed here: Pages Functions in /functions/api/*.js map to
# /api/* natively, and a redirect rule would shadow them.

/* /index.html 200
